@api = http://localhost:5081

### Health
GET {{api}}/

### Route parameter and default language
GET {{api}}/hello/An

### Query string language
GET {{api}}/hello/An?language=en

### Japanese language extension
GET {{api}}/hello/An?language=ja

### Create greeting: 201 Created
POST {{api}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Binh"
}

### Empty name: 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Read created greeting: replace ID with the value returned above
GET {{api}}/greetings/1
